            "value": "实时报告未说明扫描覆盖情况。已拒绝该报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report contained paths outside the selected scope, or paths changed during validation. It was rejected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
