            "value": "一个打开的文件描述符所指向的文件身份已变化。请重新检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fileport changed its file identity. Check again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个 fileport 文件端口所指向的文件身份已变化。请重新检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A retained observation handle is no longer present.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留用于观察的句柄已不存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A process changed identity during the observation. Check again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "观察期间，某个进程的身份发生了变化。请重新检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current-user process list changed. Check again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前用户的进程列表已发生变化。请重新检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A process exited or changed identity. Check again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "某个进程已退出或身份已变化。请重新检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file-use observation was cancelled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件使用情况观察已取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "File-use evidence could not be completely read in the stated scope.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法完整读取所述范围内的文件使用证据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A current-user process identity could not be verified.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法验证当前用户的某个进程身份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current-user process list is incomplete or exceeded its limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前用户的进程列表不完整或超出数量上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The open-file list is incomplete or exceeded its limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开文件的列表不完整或超出数量上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file-use observation reached its time limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件使用情况观察已达到时间上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Current-user process %d could not be completely checked at %@ (system error %d). It may have exited, changed, exceeded a limit, or denied access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法完整检查当前用户的进程 %d，检查阶段为 %@（系统错误 %d）。该进程可能已退出、发生变化、超出限制或拒绝访问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Native file-use coverage was denied, truncated, or incomplete.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原生文件使用情况检查被拒绝、遭到截断或未完整完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An open-file identity could not be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取一个已打开文件的身份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The disk-image inventory is still pending. Check again after it finishes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "磁盘映像清单仍在读取中。请在读取完成后重新检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The disk-image inventory reached its time limit; no file was moved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取磁盘映像清单已达到时间上限；未移动任何文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The disk-image inventory failed, emitted diagnostics, or exceeded its output limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取磁盘映像清单失败、返回了诊断信息或超出输出上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The read-only disk-image inventory could not complete.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法完成磁盘映像清单的只读检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "File moves are disabled for this operation context.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前操作场景未启用文件移动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "File moved to Trash. This does not free disk space until Trash is emptied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件已移到废纸篓。清倒废纸篓之前不会释放磁盘空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Trash outcome could not be verified. Do not repeat the move; inspect recovery and Finder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法验证移到废纸篓的结果。请勿重复移动；请查看恢复记录及访达。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This receipt has an uncertain or completed outcome. Inspect it in Finder; MoeKit will not retry automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此凭据的结果不确定，或操作已经完成。请在访达中检查；MoeKit 不会自动重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "File restored to its original Downloads path. No existing file was replaced.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件已恢复到“下载”文件夹中的原路径。未替换任何现有文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore stopped and the captured item was returned without replacing anything. Review recovery; a new restore is not automatic.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复已停止，暂存的条目已放回，未替换任何内容。请查看恢复记录；不会自动再次恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore could not be verified. Existing destinations were not overwritten; inspect the retained recovery location.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法验证恢复结果。现有目标未被覆盖；请检查保留的恢复位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The move stopped before Trash. The captured item was returned without replacing anything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移动在进入废纸篓前停止。暂存的条目已放回，未替换任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The captured item was returned, but its final recovery record could not be verified. Inspect the original and recovery locations; do not repeat the move.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂存的条目已放回，但无法验证最终恢复记录。请检查原位置及恢复位置；请勿重复移动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The move stopped before Trash. Recovery data was retained; inspect it before any new operation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移动在进入废纸篓前停止。恢复数据已保留；执行新操作前请先检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The operation could not be verified. Read recovery records before trying again; no automatic retry will occur.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法验证操作结果。再次尝试前请读取恢复记录；不会自动重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This recovery record is incomplete or unreadable. Its contents were retained; no operation will be retried automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此恢复记录不完整或无法读取。其内容已保留；不会自动重试任何操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloaded disk image": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载的磁盘映像"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select one .dmg row from the current live analysis of your local Downloads folder. The report is only a selection hint; MoeKit independently checks the file before offering a confirmation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请从本机“下载”文件夹当前的实时分析结果中选择一个 .dmg 条目。报告仅用于辅助选择；MoeKit 会独立检查文件，然后再提供确认方案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Native Trash and restore are disabled for this context.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前场景未启用原生废纸篓和恢复操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo and imported reports cannot authorize native file operations.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "示例模式和导入的报告不能授权原生文件操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A readable project catalog is required before a file operation can be prepared.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "准备文件操作前，需要可读取的项目目录记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Selected file": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review native Trash…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看原生废纸篓方案…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No eligible .dmg selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未选择符合条件的 .dmg 文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the actual operation outcome…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待实际操作结果…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking the selected operation…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在检查所选操作…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel stops before mutation when possible. If native Trash has started, MoeKit waits for its actual result and keeps the receipt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消会尽可能在文件变更前停止操作。如果原生废纸篓操作已经开始，MoeKit 会等待其实际结果并保留操作凭据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Latest actual operation outcome": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近一次实际操作结果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Outcome original path": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此次操作的原路径"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Outcome operation records": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此次操作的记录位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Actual file-operation receipt from this session": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次会话的真实文件操作凭据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recovery receipts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复凭据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read recovery records": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取恢复记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read-only listing of MoeKit’s private records. No Trash scan or automatic restore occurs. Each original-path restore needs a new confirmation and never overwrites a destination.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只读列出 MoeKit 的私有记录。不会扫描废纸篓或自动恢复。每次恢复到原路径都需要重新确认，且绝不覆盖目标位置已有的条目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No validated recovery records found": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未找到通过验证的恢复记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recovery records have not been read": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未读取恢复记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recovery record unavailable; outcome unknown": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复记录不可用；结果未知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Operation records": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "操作记录位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No restore is authorized from incomplete or unreadable records. The operation directory and any retained payload are preserved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不完整或无法读取的记录不能授权恢复。操作目录及其中保留的条目会保持原状。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reveal validated recovery location": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在访达中显示已验证的恢复位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirm native macOS Trash": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认移到 macOS 原生废纸篓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exact original path": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确切原路径"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 file · %@ (%lld bytes)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 个文件 · %@（%lld 字节）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MoeKit will move this disk image using native macOS Trash. This is not a Mole cleanup command. Moving to Trash does not free its storage; no Trash emptying is offered here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MoeKit 将使用 macOS 原生废纸篓移动此磁盘映像，不会执行 Mole 清理命令。移到废纸篓不会释放其占用的空间；此处不提供清倒废纸篓功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exact private staging path": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确切私有暂存路径"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Private journal directory": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私有日志目录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "First recovery record": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首条恢复记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The private MoeKit and InstallerRecovery parent directories and shared operations.lock and projects.json.lock files may also be created. The lock only coordinates cooperating MoeKit instances; it does not lock out other applications.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "操作还可能创建私有的 MoeKit 和 InstallerRecovery 父目录，以及共享的 operations.lock 和 projects.json.lock 文件。这些锁仅协调遵守协议的 MoeKit 实例，不能阻止其他应用访问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After confirmation, MoeKit creates this private operation directory and numbered JSON recovery records inside it. These records persist and disclose the original path only in this private journal. Closing this plan does not create them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认后，MoeKit 会创建此私有操作目录，并在其中写入带编号的 JSON 恢复记录。记录会持久保留，原路径仅记录在此私有日志中。关闭此方案不会创建这些内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No open descriptor or fileport use observed in the checked current-user processes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在已检查的当前用户进程中，未观察到通过打开的文件描述符或 fileport 文件端口使用此文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A same-user race can temporarily move a replacement before a mismatch is detected. The native Trash API uses a path. This operation is designed for ordinary cooperative local use, not malicious same-user interference.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同一用户权限下的并发操作，可能导致替换后的条目在发现不匹配前被短暂移动。原生废纸篓 API 使用路径操作。此功能适用于普通、协作式的本机使用场景，无法抵御同一用户权限下的恶意干扰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I have finished installing and using this disk image": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我已完成此磁盘映像的安装和使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirmation expires at %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认有效期至 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel plan": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消方案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move this file to Trash": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将此文件移到废纸篓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirm original-path restore": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认恢复到原路径"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Validated source": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已验证的来源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exact restore destination": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确切恢复目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Private restore staging path": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私有恢复暂存路径"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next recovery record": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下一条恢复记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore holds the shared operations.lock and projects.json.lock, creating the catalog lock only if missing, and appends numbered JSON records in this operation directory before namespace changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复期间会持有共享的 operations.lock 和 projects.json.lock；仅在项目目录锁不存在时创建它，并在更改文件位置前向此操作目录追加带编号的 JSON 记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MoeKit will recheck identities and move this exact recorded file back to its original Downloads path. A collision refuses the operation; there is no overwrite or force option. Journal records persist. Finder Put Back may target private staging instead of the original path.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MoeKit 会重新检查身份，并将记录中的这个确切文件移回“下载”文件夹的原路径。若目标位置已有条目，操作将被拒绝；不提供覆盖或强制选项。日志记录会保留。访达的“放回原处”可能将文件放回私有暂存位置，而非原路径。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore is unavailable after Trash is emptied, required identities or volumes change, or the original destination is occupied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清倒废纸篓、所需身份或宗卷发生变化，或原目标位置被占用后，将无法恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore to original path": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复到原路径"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Original path": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原路径"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recorded Trash path": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记录中的废纸篓路径"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Receipt %@ · record %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "凭据 %@ · 第 %lld 条记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review restore…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看恢复方案…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Private MoeKit parent directory": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私有 MoeKit 父目录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Private recovery root": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私有恢复根目录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shared operation lock": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共享操作锁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shared project-catalog lock": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共享项目目录锁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Full path, escaped: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完整路径（已转义）：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Capture intent recorded; verify recovery location": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已记录暂存意图；请验证恢复位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "File retained in private staging": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件保留在私有暂存位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trash intent recorded; outcome needs verification": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已记录移到废纸篓的意图；结果待验证"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moved to macOS Trash": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已移到 macOS 废纸篓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rollback intent recorded; outcome needs verification": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已记录回退意图；结果待验证"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Returned to the original path": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已放回原路径"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "File retained for recovery": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件已保留以供恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Outcome uncertain; review recovery": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "结果不确定；请查看恢复记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore capture intent recorded; review recovery": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已记录恢复暂存意图；请查看恢复记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore payload retained in private staging": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "待恢复条目保留在私有暂存位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore intent recorded; outcome needs verification": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已记录恢复意图；结果待验证"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restored to the original path": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已恢复到原路径"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · %@ · SHA-256 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · %@ · SHA-256 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live Mole result · filtered, non-atomic observation · sizes are not reclaimable space": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mole 实时结果 · 经过筛选的非原子观察 · 大小不等于可释放空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only a directly listed .dmg in the current live Downloads analysis can be selected for independent native Trash review. Imported and Demo entries cannot be used.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅可选择当前“下载”文件夹实时分析直接列出的 .dmg 文件，进行独立的原生废纸篓操作审查。导入报告和示例条目不能用于此操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MoeKit currently accepts only the original Mole V1.57.0 release analyzer. Homebrew, source builds and other versions are unsupported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MoeKit 目前仅接受 Mole V1.57.0 官方发布的原始分析器。暂不支持 Homebrew、自行编译或其他版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SHA-256: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SHA-256：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A browser download may have a macOS quarantine marker. MoeKit refuses quarantined files; neither this command nor MoeKit removes that marker or bypasses Gatekeeper. Do not retry a blocked file through another download route to evade a security warning.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "浏览器下载的文件可能带有 macOS 隔离标记，MoeKit 会拒绝这类文件。此命令和 MoeKit 都不会移除隔离标记或绕过 Gatekeeper。遇到安全警告时，请勿改用另一种下载方式来规避拦截。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Mole → Space → Analyze with Mole…, choose analyze-go at the path printed by Terminal. If already installed by Mole’s official script, its usual path is ~/.config/mole/bin/analyze-go. MoeKit still verifies the exact bytes before each run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Mole → 空间 → 使用 Mole 分析… 中，选择终端输出路径下的 analyze-go。如果此前已用 Mole 官方脚本安装，常见路径是 ~/.config/mole/bin/analyze-go。每次运行前，MoeKit 仍会核对文件的精确内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get the supported analyzer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "获取受支持的分析器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Expected size: %lld bytes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "预期大小：%lld 字节"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review the release, then optionally copy and run the download command yourself in Terminal. It creates a new private folder in your home directory, downloads one analyzer, checks its size and SHA-256, and only then makes it executable. It does not run Mole. A failed download or check leaves the new folder for you to review.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先查看发布说明，再按需复制下载命令，自行在终端中运行。命令会在你的主目录中新建一个私有文件夹，下载分析器并核对大小和 SHA-256，通过后才添加执行权限。它不会运行 Mole。下载或校验失败时，新文件夹会保留，供你检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copying only changes the clipboard. The download command accesses GitHub and writes the new folder only when you run it yourself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制仅更新剪贴板。只有你自行运行下载命令时，才会访问 GitHub 并写入新文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View the exact analyzer download": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看此分析器的官方下载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review download command": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看下载命令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asset for this app: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适用于此应用的文件：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy download command": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制下载命令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version requires a complete, empty disk-image inventory. You may eject images you opened yourself, then check again. Leave system-managed images alone; they can keep this action unavailable. MoeKit does not classify or eject images.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此版本要求完整的磁盘映像清单为空。你可以推出自己打开的映像，然后重新检查。请勿处理系统管理的映像；它们的存在可能使此操作持续不可用。MoeKit 不会对映像进行分类或代为推出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version accepts only a complete, empty disk-image inventory. Eject only images you opened yourself. Do not eject system-managed images; an inventory containing them remains unsupported. MoeKit cannot classify images for you and never ejects them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此版本仅接受完整且为空的磁盘映像清单。请仅推出你自己打开的映像。不要推出系统管理的映像；包含这类映像的清单仍不受支持。MoeKit 无法代你判断映像类别，也绝不会代为推出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checks cover current-user vnode file descriptors and fileports, plus a complete, empty disk-image inventory. Any attached image, including a system-managed image, keeps this operation unavailable; MoeKit does not classify images. Memory mappings, other users, system services and files opened after the check are not exhaustively observable. This is not proof that the image is globally unused.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查涵盖当前用户的 vnode 文件描述符和 fileport 文件端口，并要求完整的磁盘映像清单为空。任何已连接映像（包括系统管理的映像）都会使此操作不可用；MoeKit 不会对映像进行分类。无法穷尽观察内存映射、其他用户、系统服务及检查后才打开文件的情况。这不能证明该映像在整个系统中均未被使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version requires a complete, empty disk-image inventory and cannot rule out use through any attached image. Eject only images you opened yourself, then check again. Leave system-managed images alone; their presence can keep this action unavailable. MoeKit does not classify or eject images.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此版本要求完整的磁盘映像清单为空，无法排除通过任何已连接映像使用文件的情况。请仅推出你自己打开的映像，然后重新检查。请勿处理系统管理的映像；它们的存在可能使此操作持续不可用。MoeKit 不会对映像进行分类或代为推出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Requires a complete, empty disk-image inventory and checks current-user open file descriptors and fileports. Only eject images you opened yourself; leave system-managed images alone. MoeKit does not classify images, so unsupported system inventory can keep this action unavailable. Memory mappings, system processes, and other users' use are not verified. This observation is not proof that the file is unused.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要求完整的磁盘映像清单为空，并检查当前用户打开的文件描述符和 fileport 文件端口。请仅推出你自己打开的映像，不要处理系统管理的映像。MoeKit 不会对映像进行分类，因此不受支持的系统映像清单可能使此操作持续不可用。不会验证内存映射、系统进程及其他用户的使用情况。此次观察不能证明文件未被使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The disk-image inventory is incomplete or unreadable; no file was moved. You may eject images you opened yourself and check again, but leave system-managed images alone. MoeKit does not classify or eject images; unsupported system inventory can keep this action unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "磁盘映像清单不完整或无法读取；未移动任何文件。你可以推出自己打开的映像后重新检查，但请勿处理系统管理的映像。MoeKit 不会对映像进行分类或代为推出；不受支持的系统映像清单可能使此操作持续不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The exact process identity or required metadata could not be verified. No fallback signal is allowed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法核实精确进程身份或必要元数据，不会改用其他发信号方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A selected process changed or exited. Scan and review again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选进程已变化或退出，请重新扫描并复查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This selection includes a protected application, browser, shared service, system process, or MoeKit ancestor. Remove protected rows before continuing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选项包含受保护的应用、浏览器、共享服务、系统进程或 MoeKit 祖先进程。请移除受保护项后继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This confirmation expired or was already used. Review the exact targets again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此确认已过期或已经使用，请重新复查精确目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Force stop is available only for the exact processes still running after your confirmed graceful stop.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有你确认正常停止后仍在运行的同一进程身份，才能进一步确认强制停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select between 1 and 16 exact processes for one confirmation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次确认请选择 1 至 16 个精确进程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancelled or expired before sending a signal to this target.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "向此目标发送信号前已取消或过期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signal submitted; the selected process identity is no longer running.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "信号已提交，所选进程身份已不再运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signal submitted; this process is still running. Force stop requires another review and confirmation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "信号已提交，此进程仍在运行。强制停止需要另行复查并确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signal submitted; exit could not be verified. Refresh to inspect the result.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "信号已提交，但无法核实是否退出。请刷新检查结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No signal submitted: identity, protection, metadata, or operating-system permission check failed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未提交信号：身份、保护、元数据或系统权限检查未通过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The exact targets could not be prepared. No signal was sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法完成精确目标复查，未发送信号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The stop was cancelled before signal submission.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止操作在提交信号前已取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Operating-system executable path is protected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "操作系统可执行文件路径受保护。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review is not permission to stop. A fresh identity check and explicit confirmation are required.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看计划不代表授权停止，必须重新核实身份并明确确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Graceful stop sends SIGTERM to exact selected identities. Force stop requires a separate confirmation; signal submission does not prove exit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正常停止只向精确选择的身份发送 SIGTERM。强制停止需要独立确认；提交信号不代表已经退出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exact targets · stopping requires confirmation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "精确目标 · 停止需要确认"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect exact targets and risks, then prepare a fresh stop confirmation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看精确目标及风险，然后准备新的停止确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review every selected identity and its risks. Protected processes cannot be stopped here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复查每个所选身份及风险，受保护进程不能在此停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Execution version": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "执行版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review exact targets. Preparing a confirmation rechecks current identity and metadata. Protected targets must be removed before stopping.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复查精确目标。准备确认时将重新核实当前身份和元数据，停止前须移除受保护目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Browsers, applications, shared services, system processes and MoeKit ancestors are protected. Headless browser ownership cannot yet be proved from this metadata. Selecting a row does not authorize stopping it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "浏览器、应用、共享服务、系统进程及 MoeKit 祖先进程受保护。这些元数据尚不能证明无头浏览器的归属。选中行不代表授权停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirm graceful stop (SIGTERM)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认正常停止（SIGTERM）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirm force stop (SIGKILL)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认强制停止（SIGKILL）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These processes may stop immediately and lose unsaved work. A process may also stop its own children in response. MoeKit sends no group or descendant signals. This confirmation expires after 60 seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些进程可能立即停止并丢失未保存的工作；进程自身也可能连带停止其子进程。MoeKit 不向整个组或自动扩展的后代发送信号。此确认在 60 秒后过期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Force stop prevents cleanup and may lose or corrupt unsaved work. Only the listed still-running identities receive SIGKILL. This confirmation expires after 60 seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "强制停止不会等待退出清理，可能丢失或损坏未保存的工作。仅列出的仍在运行身份会收到 SIGKILL。此确认在 60 秒后过期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I checked each listed target and accept these consequences": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我已核对每个列出目标并接受上述后果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel confirmation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消此次确认"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop these processes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止这些进程"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Force stop these processes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "强制停止这些进程"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking targets and observing results…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在核对目标并观察结果…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review force stop…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复查强制停止…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prepare graceful stop…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "准备正常停止…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirm exact unprotected targets for SIGTERM; force stop requires a separate confirmation. Browser ownership remains unverified.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对精确的非受保护目标确认 SIGTERM，强制停止需另行确认；浏览器归属仍未核实。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PID %d: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PID %d：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld exact targets: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个精确目标：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last real stop result": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次真实停止结果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A confirmed stop is settling. Submitted signals cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已确认的停止操作正在核实结果。已提交的信号无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mole Space supports reports and confirmed analysis with the official V1.57.0 analyzer. Exact unprotected processes can be stopped after separate confirmation. Cleanup and uninstall remain unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mole Space 支持报告和确认后的官方 V1.57.0 分析。精确选择的非受保护进程可独立确认停止。清理与卸载仍不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A snapshot is read only when you choose Start scan or Refresh: current-user executable names and paths, working directories, and TCP listening endpoints. Arguments and environment variables are not read. Scanning sends no signals; stopping requires a separate confirmation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在你选择开始扫描或刷新时读取当前用户的可执行文件名称与路径、工作目录和 TCP 监听端点。不读取命令参数或环境变量。扫描不发送信号；停止需要另行确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Choose a folder and inspect": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 选择文件夹并检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Select caches to review": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. 选择要复查的缓存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Confirm these exact caches": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. 确认这些精确缓存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A filename could not be displayed without changing its bytes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "某个文件名无法在保留原始字节的情况下准确显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A readable project catalog is required before cache cleanup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清理缓存前需要可读取的项目目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A readable project catalog is required before cleanup can be reviewed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复查清理操作前需要可读取的项目目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A saved project, worktree, or protected control location overlaps this cache.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此缓存与已保存的项目、工作树或受保护的控制文件位置重叠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A socket, device, pipe, or unsupported entry is present. Close the owning app and inspect again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发现套接字、设备、管道或不支持的项目。请关闭所属应用后重新检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Actual operations from this session, not example data": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次会话的真实操作，非示例数据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After confirmation, MoeKit may create private parent directories, coordination locks, per-item staging directories and numbered recovery records here. Records disclose these original paths and persist after the operation. Closing this plan creates none of them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认后，MoeKit 可能在此创建私有父目录、协调锁、各项目的暂存目录和编号恢复记录。记录包含原始路径，并在操作后保留。关闭此计划不会创建这些内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another cleanup operation is active. Wait for its actual result.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另一项清理操作仍在进行，请等待实际结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cache": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缓存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cache Trash operation requires review": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缓存废纸篓操作需要复查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cache candidates, select one or more eligible rows": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缓存候选项，请选择一个或多个可用行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cache moved to Trash": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缓存已移入废纸篓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cache outcome uncertain; review recovery records": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缓存操作结果不确定，请复查恢复记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cache permanently deleted": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缓存已永久删除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cache recovery receipts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缓存恢复记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cache restore requires review": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缓存恢复需要复查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cache restored": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缓存已恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cache retained for recovery": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缓存已保留以便恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel stops before the next mutation when possible. A started native operation may finish; its actual per-item outcomes and recovery records remain available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消会尽可能在下一次更改前停止。已开始的原生操作仍可能完成，其实际逐项结果和恢复记录会被保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancelled before this item was changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已在更改此项目之前取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a cache location inside your own home folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请选择你自己个人文件夹中的缓存位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a folder whose direct-child cache directories you want to inspect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择包含要检查的直属缓存子目录的文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose folder containing caches…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择包含缓存的文件夹…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose user caches": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择用户缓存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose your user cache folder, or a folder containing directories with a valid CACHEDIR.TAG. Only eligible direct-child directories are offered. A cache name or marker does not prove the contents are disposable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择用户缓存文件夹，或包含有效 CACHEDIR.TAG 目录的文件夹。仅提供符合条件的直属子目录。缓存名称或标记不代表其中内容一定可以丢弃。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choosing a folder does not scan it. Inspect reads a bounded, complete inventory without following symbolic links or changing cache contents.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择文件夹不会扫描它。检查会在预算范围内读取完整清单，不跟随符号链接，也不更改缓存内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cleanup could not be verified. Read recovery records before retrying; no automatic retry will occur.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法验证清理结果。重试前请读取恢复记录；不会自动重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cleanup recovery records could not be verified. Retained data will not be removed automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法验证清理恢复记录。保留的数据不会被自动删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cleanup stopped. The receipt shows retained or uncertain data; nothing is retried automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清理已停止。记录显示数据已保留或结果不确定；不会自动重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cleanup was cancelled. Review any actual outcomes before trying again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清理已取消。再次尝试前请复查已经发生的实际结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close apps, builds, sync jobs and other workloads using these caches first. Inventory and identity checks cannot prove global non-use or prevent every same-user race.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先关闭使用这些缓存的应用、构建、同步任务和其他工作负载。清单与身份检查无法证明全局未使用，也无法防止所有同用户并发变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Complete reviewed path inventory": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完整复查路径清单"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Direct child of your macOS user Caches folder. This location suggests cache data; review the contents and confirm that you can regenerate them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是 macOS 用户 Caches 文件夹的直属子目录。此位置提示其可能为缓存数据；请复查内容并确认可以重新生成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Explicit read-only listing of MoeKit’s cache receipts. No broad Trash scan or automatic recovery occurs. Restore and permanent deletion each require a fresh review and separate confirmation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主动以只读方式列出 MoeKit 的缓存记录。不广泛扫描废纸篓，也不自动恢复。恢复和永久删除均需重新复查并分别确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Explicit selection · native macOS Trash": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "明确选择 · 原生 macOS 废纸篓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Git metadata or a protected credential/configuration name was found inside this candidate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此候选项内发现 Git 元数据或受保护的凭据／配置文件名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Git projects, worktrees and unverified build artifacts are protected. No Mole cleanup command, package removal, project deletion or broad Trash emptying runs here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Git 项目、工作树和未验证的构建产物受到保护。这里不运行 Mole 清理命令、软件包卸载、项目删除或整体清空废纸篓。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I have stopped the apps and workloads using every selected cache": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我已停止使用所有选中缓存的应用和工作负载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I reviewed the full paths and can regenerate all selected content": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我已复查完整路径，并能重新生成所有选中内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I understand this exact cache will be permanently deleted and cannot be restored": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我理解此精确缓存将被永久删除，且无法恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Incomplete records cannot authorize restore or deletion. Retained data is preserved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不完整的记录不能授权恢复或删除。保留的数据不会被移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect selected folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查所选文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Latest actual per-item outcomes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近一次实际逐项结果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Logical bytes are not guaranteed physically reclaimed space. Open files, APFS snapshots, clones and filesystem behavior can retain storage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逻辑字节数不保证等于实际释放空间。打开的文件、APFS 快照、克隆和文件系统行为可能继续占用存储。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Logical size": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逻辑大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Logical sizes are not a physical-space recovery estimate": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逻辑大小不是实际可释放空间的估算"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MoeKit will move this exact recorded cache back to its original path after rechecking it. An occupied destination refuses the restore; nothing is overwritten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MoeKit 将重新检查并把记录中的精确缓存移回原路径。目标已存在时会拒绝恢复，不会覆盖任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MoeKit will recheck and move only these reviewed cache directories to native macOS Trash. Files remain stored in Trash; this step does not free their storage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MoeKit 将重新检查，并仅把这些已复查的缓存目录移入原生 macOS 废纸篓。文件仍存储在废纸篓中；此步骤不会释放其占用空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move selected caches to Trash": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将所选缓存移入废纸篓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moved to Trash. No disk-space release is claimed; restore or permanent deletion requires another review.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已移入废纸篓。这不代表磁盘空间已释放；恢复或永久删除需要另一次复查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Native cache cleanup": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原生缓存清理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Native cleanup is unavailable in Demo. Actual operation receipts from this session remain visible.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "示例模式下无法执行原生清理。本次会话的真实操作记录仍会显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No eligible cache candidates were found in this folder. This does not prove the folder is empty.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文件夹中未找到符合条件的缓存候选项。这不代表文件夹为空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No folder selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未选择文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not attempted. An earlier item stopped or the batch was cancelled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未尝试执行。之前的项目已停止，或批次已取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ownership, volume, file flags, or write permissions make this cache unsupported. Permissions were not changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有权、卷、文件标志或写入权限不满足此缓存操作的条件。未更改权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Permanent cache deletion interrupted": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缓存永久删除已中断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Permanent deletion did not begin. The file tree is retained at its recorded recovery location; inspect it before any new action.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未开始永久删除。文件树保留在记录的恢复位置；再次操作前请先检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Permanent deletion stopped after it began. Some confirmed entries may already be removed; remaining data is retained. No automatic retry is allowed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "永久删除开始后已停止。部分已确认项目可能已移除，其余数据已保留。不允许自动重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Permanently delete this cache": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "永久删除此缓存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Permanently removed the confirmed cache entries. Restore is no longer available. Open files, hard links and APFS snapshots may delay or reduce physical space reclaimed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已永久移除确认的缓存项目，无法再恢复。打开的文件、硬链接和 APFS 快照可能延迟或减少实际释放的空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read cache recovery records": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取缓存恢复记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore stopped. The exact recovery location is retained in the receipt; no destination was overwritten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复已停止。精确恢复位置保留在记录中，未覆盖任何目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore this cache": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复此缓存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restored to its original location without replacing any existing file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已恢复到原位置，未替换任何现有文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review cache restore…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复查缓存恢复…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review caches before changing files": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更改文件前先复查缓存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review permanent deletion…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复查永久删除…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review selected caches…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复查所选缓存…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review status": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复查状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Standard CACHEDIR.TAG signature found. The tag is a claim by the folder creator, not permission or proof that every file is disposable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已找到标准 CACHEDIR.TAG 签名。此标记是文件夹创建者的声明，不是授权，也不能证明每个文件都可以丢弃。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Symbolic links are included as links only. Their destinations are not followed or included.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "符号链接仅作为链接处理，不跟随或包含其目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cache tag is missing, changed, or does not contain the standard signature.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缓存标记缺失、发生变化或不包含标准签名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The complete cache inventory exceeded its safety budget. Nothing was authorized; choose a smaller cache folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完整缓存清单超出安全预算。未授权任何操作；请选择更小的缓存文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected cache, contents, or containing folder changed. Inspect again; the old confirmation cannot be reused.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选缓存、内容或包含它的文件夹发生了变化。请重新检查；旧确认无法再次使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This cache could not be fully verified. Git ancestry, ownership, links in containing folders, cloud metadata, active writes, or inaccessible contents may make it unsupported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法完整验证此缓存。Git 上级目录、所有权、父目录链接、云端元数据、正在写入或无法访问的内容可能使其不受支持。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This cleanup confirmation expired or was already used. Review a new plan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此清理确认已过期或已使用。请复查新计划。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This cleanup receipt is incomplete or unreadable. Its data is retained; no restore or deletion can be authorized from it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此清理记录不完整或无法读取。数据已保留，不能据此授权恢复或删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This operation appends private recovery records. If interrupted or only partly completed, inspect the per-item outcome and read recovery records before deciding what to do next.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作会追加私有恢复记录。如中断或仅部分完成，请先检查逐项结果并读取恢复记录，再决定下一步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes only this receipt’s validated cache and the complete contents listed above. It cannot be undone through Trash or MoeKit. Other Trash items are not selected or emptied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将永久删除此记录中已验证的缓存及上方列出的全部内容，无法通过废纸篓或 MoeKit 撤销。不选择或清空废纸篓中的其他项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This system, security, or MoeKit cache is protected in this version.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此版本保护系统、安全或 MoeKit 自身的缓存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This tree exceeds the bounded directory-descriptor budget for permanent removal. Restore it or manage it in Finder; no deletion was authorized.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文件树超出永久移除的目录描述符预算。请恢复它或在 Finder 中管理；未授权删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Command-click or Shift-click to select multiple eligible rows. Blocked rows cannot be selected for cleanup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 Command 点按或 Shift 点按选择多个符合条件的行。无法选择被阻止的行进行清理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
