          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mole Space supports reports and confirmed analysis with the official V1.57.0 analyzer. Native cache cleanup and stopping exact unprotected processes each require separate confirmation. Uninstall remains unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mole Space 支持报告和使用官方 V1.57.0 分析器进行逐次确认的分析。原生缓存清理和结束精确选中的未受保护进程均需单独确认。卸载功能尚未开放。"
          }
